# Adrian Martikov travelling with the party (docs/voice/adrian_martikov.md): short lines a guest says while walking with the party, shown and voiced
# like banter (story/banter.gd). The node's name says when it may play: quest_ on entering an area while their story is
# at that point (these come first), place_ on entering an area, fight_ after a won fight, idle_ now and then on the
# road. Each plays once per playthrough, only while Adrian is with the party. Every line here is unvoiced for now.

~ quest_bracken
if guest:adrian_martikov and region:yester_hill and not flag.elvir_remains_recovered
interject guest:adrian_martikov: This is the bracken. I came down through here last spring with his voice still in my ears. Fly, he said. So I flew.
endif
-> END

~ quest_carry
if guest:adrian_martikov and flag.elvir_remains_recovered and not flag.elvir_buried
interject guest:adrian_martikov: I'm carrying him the whole way down. Nobody offer. He'd have done it for me, and complained about my weight the entire time.
endif
-> END

~ quest_message
if guest:adrian_martikov and flag.elvir_message_found and not flag.martikovs_reconciled
interject guest:adrian_martikov: He gave the order in Father's voice. Of course he did. He knew it was the only voice I'd ever obey.
endif
-> END

~ quest_hill_broken
if guest:adrian_martikov and quest.wizard_of_wines == hill_broken
interject guest:adrian_martikov: The hill's quiet. I thought I'd feel something grand. Mostly I feel like a bath, and a very large cup of our own wine.
endif
-> END

~ quest_black_row
if guest:adrian_martikov and region:wizard_of_wines and quest.the_black_row and quest.the_black_row != cut_out and quest.the_black_row != done
interject guest:adrian_martikov: I picked that row every night for a month. I knew it wasn't him. I went anyway, because it was the only place he still talked to me.
endif
-> END

~ quest_row_cut
if guest:adrian_martikov and quest.the_black_row == cut_out
interject guest:adrian_martikov: Black sap to the elbows. Father will smell it on me before I open my mouth. Good. It saves me deciding how to start.
endif
-> END

~ place_winery_lost
if guest:adrian_martikov and region:wizard_of_wines and not flag.winery_reclaimed
interject guest:adrian_martikov: Druids in our cellar, drinking nothing, because we hid the good casks first. It's the only part of this I'm proud of.
endif
-> END

~ place_winery_ours
if guest:adrian_martikov and region:wizard_of_wines and flag.winery_reclaimed
interject guest:adrian_martikov: The press-house roof still leaks over the third vat. I told Father in the spring. He'll say I should have mended it. He'll be right.
endif
-> END

~ place_vallaki
if guest:adrian_martikov and region:vallaki
interject guest:adrian_martikov: My brother Urwin keeps the Blue Water Inn. He'll smile at you like a bishop and water your wine. Tell him I said so.
endif
-> END

~ place_village
if guest:adrian_martikov and region:village_of_barovia
interject guest:adrian_martikov: The Blood of the Vine hasn't had a cask from us since spring. Whatever they're pouring now, I'd rather not know.
endif
-> END

~ fight_feathers
if guest:adrian_martikov
interject guest:adrian_martikov: Feathers in my mouth again. I'd forgotten how much I hate that part.
endif
-> END

~ fight_useful
if guest:adrian_martikov
interject guest:adrian_martikov: Everyone still standing? Good. Tell Father I was useful. He won't believe you, but tell him.
endif
-> END

~ fight_second
if guest:adrian_martikov
interject guest:adrian_martikov: Elvir always went in first. I went in second and got blamed. Some things you don't grow out of.
endif
-> END

~ idle_pruning
if guest:adrian_martikov
interject guest:adrian_martikov: The south slope wants pruning, and the druids want killing. Only one of those is relaxing, and it isn't the pruning.
endif
-> END

~ idle_quiet
if guest:adrian_martikov
interject guest:adrian_martikov: Elvir talked the whole way up every hill we ever climbed. I keep waiting for him to start.
endif
-> END

~ idle_raven
if guest:adrian_martikov
interject guest:adrian_martikov: If you hear a raven laughing behind us, it isn't me. Probably.
endif
-> END
